This crate incorporates and adapts source code from brush-core 0.5.0 and
brush-parser 0.4.0 (https://github.com/reubeno/brush), used under the MIT
License. The source is compiled directly into omp-shell-engine;
omp-shell-engine does not depend on the brush crates.

Copyright (c) 2024 reuben olinsky

The brush-core source includes local fixes for Windows path handling,
background process IDs, macOS `/dev/null` polling, and broken-pipe exit status.
omp-shell-engine additionally removes interactive-shell machinery and integrates
the parser and base shell builtins into one standalone engine crate.

